    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d479">

                <pb facs="0573" n="485" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg485"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Clayton to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-03-11"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 11, 1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2193.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my No. 2187 of the 8th
                    instant, I have the honor to inclose copy and translation of note from Mr.
                    Mariscal, stating that he has been informed by the third circuit court that the
                    district court of Sonora dismissed the case against Engineer C. O. Bean, and
                    ordered the return to the Sonora Railway of the cash bail of $300, Bean having
                    been unconditionally released.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Powell Clayton.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d479-a1.xml" xpointer="d479-a1"/>
            </div>
